- **`process/skill-activation.md`** - Bare-activation intake, the enablement
  response, and standby.
- **`process/skill-maintenance.md`** - Maintenance-mode intake and validation gate.
- **`process/json-exchange.md`** - JSON parameter documents for question surfaces.
- **`process/operation-timing.md`** - Elapsed-time report for named operations
- **`process/operations-catalog.md`** - The catalog procedure for "list all operations" requests.
  under a verbose, informational, diagnostic, or timing mode.
- **`process/decision-modes.md`** - The interaction-mode matrix and decision log.
- **`process/session-review.md`** - Session review with the shared review modes.
